# Pinned upstream commits (full SHAs: GitHub refuses `git fetch` of an
# abbreviated SHA). Image tags use the first 12 characters.
# llama-server (Spark) and ggml-rpc-server (x86 workers) MUST come from the
# same LLAMA_SHA: the RPC wire protocol changes between commits.
LLAMA_SHA=547208dca250ceb3e4c8615598d043f2b602a527
PULSAR_SHA=18f990094e1091ee2ef3078f20be418f8c162f03
# The llama.cpp build tag of LLAMA_SHA: the server's prebuilt web UI is fetched from the ggml-org/llama-ui bucket
# by this version (HF_UI_VERSION). A depth-1 checkout has no build number, resolves "latest" and fails the asset
# manifest check once upstream moves on (images run 46065121968, 2026-11-27).
LLAMA_BUILD_TAG=b11718
